# Citation metadata for this repository (https://citation-file-format.github.io/).
# `version`, `date-released` and `doi` name the v1.0 release and its Zenodo
# deposit (the DOI was reserved before the release was tagged, so that the
# paper's Data/artifact availability statement and this file carry the same
# identifiers); the deposit is published on the day of the TQE submission.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or these result files, please cite the paper (preferred
  citation below) and the archived release of this repository.
type: software
title: >-
  Reproduction package for "Measuring Metric and Sampling Distortions in
  Penalty-Encoded QAOA Portfolio Benchmarks"
authors:
