keywords:
  - QAOA
  - portfolio optimization
  - QUBO
  - penalty method
  - benchmark reproducibility
  - Amazon Braket
abstract: >-
  Code, the derived input statistics of the two price windows (annualised
  mean returns and covariance of the fifty-ticker universe), per-run and
  per-instance result files, figure scripts and table-checking scripts for the
  paper. The MIT licence covers the source code; the author-generated result
  files and the derived statistics are released under CC BY 4.0; the market-data
  snapshots they were computed from are third-party data and are not
  redistributed (see data/README.md).
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-09-14
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22743582
